    "detailed_description": "Chromacell is a horizontal scrolling retro style 2D shoot 'em up with colourful pixel-art graphics.<br><br>Select one of four difficulty modes and take on the enemy hoards!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br>Engage enemies on land and in the air<br><br>10 uniquely themed stages to conquer<br><br>'No bullet mode' for beginners<br><br>Power-up your weapons and thrusters<br><br>Play with keyboard or gamepad<br><br>Survive dangerous boss battles<br><br>Find secrets for extra points<br><br>Local and Steam Cloud saves",
    "about_the_game": "Chromacell is a horizontal scrolling retro style 2D shoot 'em up with colourful pixel-art graphics.<br><br>Select one of four difficulty modes and take on the enemy hoards!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br>Engage enemies on land and in the air<br><br>10 uniquely themed stages to conquer<br><br>'No bullet mode' for beginners<br><br>Power-up your weapons and thrusters<br><br>Play with keyboard or gamepad<br><br>Survive dangerous boss battles<br><br>Find secrets for extra points<br><br>Local and Steam Cloud saves",
    "short_description": "In this sideways scrolling shmup, take control of your spaceship and navigate through vibrant pixelated environments filled with hordes of enemy spacecraft. Upgrade your ship and weapons, dodge enemy fire while blasting through each stage. Emerge victorious as the ultimate space pilot!",
